{
  "id": "32",
  "title": "论妻妾",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“论妻妾”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "正财为正妻，偏财妾也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-380e37766c6891fedf4b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲木见己土为正财，戊土为偏财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-a23720f7db3346e431af-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "又见乙木局，亥卯未伤妻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-9a815f35582a0a87c1fe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲寅剋妻也，更主妻不正。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-20209828586e9718be74-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财衰败墓绝，主妻有疾不贤，否则年高再嫁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-a09068dbca165615c666-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见癸字，则妾不正。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-131c5297d7e356825d39-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见己土丑未字，则主自安。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-e46ebdc01da443569b33-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "比肩分夺、财临沐浴桃花，主妻妾私通。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-ca74033701eadef169c3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日下月下坐财官，主妻多内助，更得妻财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-c1b15417ec2cc31ee553-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "偏财得位，妾胜于妻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-6f10b035c008fa729a63-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "主财自旺，妻不容妾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-ddbb2e8afe8cd92c5d0e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀重见，妻招干蛊可畏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-e3eee308352752f97f84-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官并美，为人怕妻；见杀尤忌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-c5a636c3688a2a551e8e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财多身弱，妻反胜夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-996115d3748c5340ca07-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财命有气，妻妾和顺，是得妻力。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-3904cbdad3d5f310c27a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日坐空亡，难为妻妾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-d2139571e95f9fff1c1b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "又看孤鸞之日、阳错阴错，主剋妻；或因亲致眷、寒房冷娶、入赘填房。女人犯此，主父母家陵替、或致讼事。餘倣此例。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "32-9b2288a94e387e3db093-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
